# Final v1.0.0 candidate (2026-11-06): partial caps Mind/Act 30/22/15, CP 15/10/7; core units only; PR1/PR2 error banding; E2 per-digit, M2 per-pair; CP07/S2 text per review.
# key: (title, capability_en, capability_zh, goal_en, goal_zh, desc_en, desc_zh, comp_en, comp_zh, score_en[list], score_zh[list])
A_END_EN='After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.'
A_END_ZH='你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。'
B_END_EN='The episode ends when the required sequence is complete (or the budget is used); the recorded events and final state are scored.'
B_END_ZH='规定的序列完成即结束（或预算用完）；按记录的事件和结束时状态计分。'
R={'PR1': ('Rheostat Resistance Adjustment',
         'Precision linear control — set a sliding contact to a target reading.',
         '精确直线控制——把滑动触点调到目标读数。',
         'Goal: Slide the rheostat wiper so that the resistance between the left terminal and the wiper reads {TARGET} Ω.',
         '目标：滑动电阻器触点，使左端与触点之间的电阻为 {TARGET}Ω。',
         'The rheostat spans 0–40 Ω. Read the position from the orange indicator against the scale; the target may lie between two minor ticks, so interpolate. You may reverse and regrasp.',
         '电阻器量程 0–40Ω。从橙色指示线对照刻度读数；目标可能在两个小刻度之间，需要估读。可以反向调整、重新抓取。',
         'Success: the measured resistance is within ±0.2 / ±0.15 / ±0.12 Ω (Easy / Medium / Hard) of {TARGET} Ω. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon '
         'as it holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
         '成功：实测阻值与 {TARGET}Ω 相差 ≤0.2 / 0.15 / 0.12 Ω（Easy / Medium / Hard）。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
         ['100: the resistance is within ±0.2 / ±0.15 / ±0.12 Ω (Easy / Medium / Hard) of the target.',
          'Otherwise: 30 / 22 / 15 × (1 − error ÷ 8 / 4 / 2 Ω); 0 when the error is at least 8 / 4 / 2 Ω.'],
         ['100：阻值与目标差在 ±0.2 / ±0.15 / ±0.12 Ω（Easy / Medium / Hard）内。', '否则：30 / 22 / 15 × (1 − 误差 ÷ 8 / 4 / 2 Ω)；误差 ≥ 8 / 4 / 2 Ω 时为 0。']),
 'PR2': ('Voltage Knob Adjustment',
         'Precision rotary control — set a passive knob to a target reading.',
         '精确旋转控制——把被动旋钮调到目标读数。',
         'Goal: Turn the knob so that the output voltage reads {TARGET} V.',
         '目标：转动旋钮，使输出电压为 {TARGET}V。',
         'The knob is passive: it turns only when pushed or grasped and otherwise keeps its angle. Read the dial in the camera images and interpolate between the smallest ticks. You may reverse and '
         'regrasp.',
         '旋钮是被动的：只有被推动或抓住时才转，否则保持角度。从相机画面读表盘，在最小刻度之间估读。可以反向调整、重新抓取。',
         'Success: the measured voltage is within ±1 / ±0.5 / ±0.5 V (Easy / Medium / Hard) of {TARGET} V. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it '
         'holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
         '成功：实测电压与 {TARGET}V 相差 ≤1 / 0.5 / 0.5 V（Easy / Medium / Hard）。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
         ['100: the voltage is within ±1 / ±0.5 / ±0.5 V (Easy / Medium / Hard) of the target.',
          'Otherwise: 30 / 22 / 15 × (1 − error ÷ 40 / 20 / 10 V); 0 when the error is at least 40 / 20 / 10 V.'],
         ['100：电压与目标差在 ±1 / ±0.5 / ±0.5 V（Easy / Medium / Hard）内。', '否则：30 / 22 / 15 × (1 − 误差 ÷ 40 / 20 / 10 V)；误差 ≥ 40 / 20 / 10 V 时为 0。']),
 'PR3': ('Path Tracing',
         'Precision drawing — reproduce a visible reference path with real ink.',
         '精确描线——用真实笔迹复现可见的参考路径。',
         'Goal: Grasp the marker and trace the complete visible path on the paper.',
         '目标：拿起笔，把纸上可见的路径完整描一遍。',
         'The reference path has several bends (about 350 mm long on Hard). Only ink actually left on the paper counts.',
         '参考路径有多处弯折（Hard 约 350mm 长）。只算纸上真实留下的墨迹。',
         'Coverage = share of the reference path within 3 mm of ink; accuracy = arc-length-weighted RMS distance from ink to the path. Success: coverage ≥98% and RMS ≤2 mm. After each of your '
         'actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
         '覆盖率 = 参考路径中离墨迹 ≤3mm 的比例；精度 = 墨迹到路径的弧长加权均方根距离。成功：覆盖率 ≥98% 且精度 ≤2mm。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
         ['100: coverage ≥98% and RMS ≤2 mm.', '30 / 22 / 15: exactly one of the two holds.', '0: neither holds, or no ink.'],
         ['100：覆盖率 ≥98% 且 RMS ≤2mm。', '30 / 22 / 15：只满足一项。', '0：都不满足或没有墨迹。']),
 'PR4': ('Cloth Folding',
         'Deformable manipulation — fold cloth into a target shape.',
         '柔性物体操作——把布折成目标形状。',
         'Goal: Fold the cloth into the displayed target shape inside the target frame on the table (Easy: rectangle; Medium: triangle; Hard: trapezoid).',
         '目标：把布折成显示的目标形状，放在桌面目标框内（Easy 长方形、Medium 三角形、Hard 梯形）。',
         'Any folding strategy is allowed.The cloth must rest on the table.',
         '折法不限。布须放在桌面上。',
         "The folded cloth is compared in place with the target outline. Success: median outline error <15 mm, 90th-percentile error <25 mm (Hard: maximum error <10 mm), and ≥98% of the cloth's "
         'projected area within the target outline expanded by 10 mm. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends with 100. '
         'Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
         '折好的布与目标轮廓原位比较。成功：轮廓误差中位数 <15mm、90% 点 <25mm（Hard 最大误差 <10mm），且 ≥98% 投影面积落在外扩 10mm 的目标轮廓内。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
         ['100: outline and area conditions all hold.', '0: otherwise.'],
         ['100：轮廓与面积条件全部满足。', '0：其他。']),
 'PR5': ('Stamping',
         'Precision placement with a tool — make one aligned impression and return the tool.',
         '工具精确操作——盖一个对准的印并放回工具。',
         'Goal: Use stamp A to make exactly one complete impression fully inside the blue box with its arrow aligned to the target arrow, without dragging, then return the stamp to its holder in its '
         'original orientation.',
         '目标：用印章 A 在蓝框内盖一个完整的印，箭头对准目标箭头，不要拖印，然后把印章按原朝向放回托架。',
         'Blue box side 100 / 80 / 74 mm; heading tolerance 5° / 2° / 1° (Easy / Medium / Hard). Opposite or quarter-turn headings are wrong. The impression is judged from the ink actually on the '
         'paper.',
         '蓝框边长 100/80/74mm；方向容差 5°/2°/1°（Easy/Medium/Hard）。反向或转 90° 都算错。按纸上真实墨迹判断。',
         'Success: exactly one clean impression inside the box within the heading tolerance, and the stamp sits in its holder (horizontal <4 mm, vertical <2 mm, yaw <3°, tilt <3°). After each of '
         'your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is '
         'scored.',
         '成功：框内恰好一个干净的印、方向在容差内，且印章回到托架（水平 <4mm、高度 <2mm、偏航 <3°、倾斜 <3°）。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
         ['100: correct single impression and stamp back in the holder.',
          '30 / 22 / 15: correct impression, stamp not back.',
          '15 / 11 / 7.5: single impression in the box but heading outside tolerance.',
          '0: no impression, more than one, dragged, or outside the box.'],
         ['100：单个合格印且印章回托架。', '30 / 22 / 15：印合格但没放回。', '15 / 11 / 7.5：印在框内但方向不对。', '0：无印、多印、拖印或出框。']),
 'PR6': ('Domino Chain',
         'Physical causal planning — build a chain that propagates to a target.',
         '物理因果规划——搭出能传到目标的连锁。',
         'Goal: Stand the dominos inside the curved band in order along the curve, then push the first one so the chain topples and the last domino strikes the bell.',
         '目标：把骨牌按顺序立在弯曲带内，推倒第一块，让骨牌连锁倒下，最后一块撞到铃。',
         '5 / 7 / 9 dominos (Easy / Medium / Hard); no individual target slots. At most 8 pushes in total. If the chain stalls, wait at least 3 s; you may restart from a later domino only when all '
         'earlier ones have fallen. Do not touch the bell or a domino that is falling.',
         '5/7/9 块骨牌（Easy/Medium/Hard），没有固定槽位。总共最多推 8 次。连锁停住时至少等 3 秒；前面全部倒下后才能从后面某块重新推。不要碰铃，也不要碰正在倒的骨牌。',
         'Success: all dominos topple through the chain and the last one touches the bell, within 8 pushes, without touching the bell or a falling domino. After each of your actions the environment '
         'checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
         '成功：8 次以内，所有骨牌经连锁倒下、最后一块碰到铃，且没碰铃、没碰正在倒的骨牌。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
         ['100: all topple and the last touches the bell.',
          '30 / 22 / 15: the chain topples at least the first 3 / 4 / 5 dominos.',
          '15 / 11 / 7.5: a complete legal setup was built.',
          '0: no setup, more than 8 pushes, or you touched the bell or a falling domino.'],
         ['100：全部倒下且末块碰铃。', '30 / 22 / 15：从第一块起连续倒下 ≥3/4/5 块。', '15 / 11 / 7.5：摆成完整合法的链。', '0：没摆成、推超过 8 次、碰铃或碰正在倒的骨牌。']),
 'DR1': ('Conveyor Parcel Catching',
         'Timed continuous pick-and-place — take moving parcels before they leave reach.',
         '连续限时抓放——在包裹离开可达范围前取走。',
         'Goal: Pick up all 3 / 5 / 7 parcels from the moving conveyor and place them in the central collection tray.',
         '目标：把传送带上的 3/5/7 个包裹全部放进中间的收集盘。',
         'Parcels arrive one after another; the conveyor keeps running. A parcel counts when it is supported by the tray, not held up by the gripper.',
         '包裹一个接一个到来，传送带一直在动。包裹被盘子托住（不是悬在夹爪里）就算进盘。',
         'Success: all N parcels are in the tray. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the episode runs '
         'until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
         '成功：N 个包裹全部进盘。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
         ['100: all parcels in the tray.', 'Otherwise: 30 / 22 / 15 × (parcels in tray) / N, N = 3 / 5 / 7.'],
         ['100：全部进盘。', '否则：30 / 22 / 15 × 进盘数 / N（N=3/5/7）。']),
 'DR2': ('Cued Button Response',
         'Timed reactive control — respond to cues within a time limit.',
         '限时反应控制——在时限内响应提示。',
         'Goal: For each of 10 cues, press the lit button within 4.0 / 3.2 / 2.6 s and let it return within 1 s; never press an unlit button.',
         '目标：10 次亮灯，每次在 4.0/3.2/2.6 秒内按下亮着的按钮，并在 1 秒内让它弹回；不要按没亮的按钮。',
         'Three buttons light one at a time. A press counts at ≥2.5 mm travel; a return counts below 0.8 mm. If the same button lights again, let it return first and press again. A missed cue does '
         'not end the episode; all 10 cues are run.',
         '三个按钮依次亮灯。按下 ≥2.5mm 算按下，回到 <0.8mm 算弹回。同一按钮再次亮起时，先让它弹回再按。错过某次不会结束本局，10 次都会走完。',
         'A cue is correct when its lit button is pressed and returned within the limits. The episode ends when the required sequence is complete (or the budget is used); the recorded events and '
         'final state are scored.',
         '某次亮灯在时限内按下并弹回对应按钮即为正确。规定的序列完成即结束（或预算用完）；按记录的事件和结束时状态计分。',
         ['100: all 10 cues correct and no unlit button ever pressed.', 'Otherwise: 3 / 2.2 / 1.5 points per correct cue (a wrong press does not cancel other cues).'],
         ['100：10 次全对且从未按没亮的按钮。', '否则：每次正确 3 / 2.2 / 1.5 分（按错不影响其他次）。']),
 'DR3': ('Timed-Gate Delivery',
         'Dynamic timing — pass moving gates and deliver an object.',
         '动态时机——穿过移动的门并送达物体。',
         'Goal: Grasp the eraser, time the moving gate(s), pass through the opening (Hard: the blue opening, then the orange one) and put the eraser in the green tray behind.',
         '目标：拿起橡皮，掌握门的开合时机，从门洞穿过（Hard 先蓝门后橙门），把橡皮放进后面的绿色托盘。',
         'Pass only while the gate is open and do not go around it. A long gripper may span both Hard gates at once as long as it enters blue before orange.',
         '只能在门打开时穿过，不能绕门。Hard 中夹爪可以同时跨过两道门，只要先进蓝门再进橙门。',
         'Success: the eraser passes through in the required order and ends supported in the green tray. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it '
         'holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
         '成功：橡皮按要求顺序穿门，最终被绿色托盘托住。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
         ['100: passed in order and delivered to the tray.', '7.5 / 5.5 / 3.75: passed through but not delivered.', '0: otherwise.'],
         ['100：按序穿门并送达托盘。', '7.5 / 5.5 / 3.75：穿过但没送到。', '0：其他。']),
 'DR4': ('Tray Transport and Balance',
         'Balance under transport — move a tray without spilling its balls.',
         '搬运中的平衡——搬托盘不让球滚出。',
         'Goal: Carry the tray by its handle to the delivery platform (Medium: around one column; Hard: around two staggered columns), keeping each ball inside its marked circle.',
         '目标：握住把手把托盘搬到交付平台（Medium 绕过一根柱子，Hard 绕过两根错开的柱子），每个球都留在自己的标记圈内。',
         "Circle radius 30 / 25 / 20 mm (+0.5 mm tolerance). Every ball's position relative to the tray is recorded throughout. Delivered means the tray rests on the platform within 20 mm "
         'horizontally and 3 mm vertically. Do not hit obstacles.',
         '圈半径 30/25/20mm（+0.5mm 容差）。全程记录每个球相对托盘的位置。送达 = 托盘放在平台上，水平误差 ≤20mm、高度误差 <3mm。不要撞障碍物。',
         'Success: no ball ever left its circle and the tray is delivered. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends with 100. '
         'Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
         '成功：球全程没出过圈，且托盘送达。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
         ['100: no ball ever left its circle and the tray is delivered.',
          '30 / 22 / 15: a ball left its circle, but at the end all balls are back in their circles and the tray is delivered.',
          '0: otherwise, including hitting an obstacle.'],
         ['100：全程无球出圈且送达。', '30 / 22 / 15：中途有球出圈，但结束时全部回圈且送达。', '0：其他，含撞到障碍物。']),
 'E1': ('Repeated-Item Identification',
        'Episodic memory — find the item repeated from earlier batches.',
        '情景记忆——找出之前批次出现过的物品。',
        'Goal: Observe each batch. From the second batch on, put the one item that appeared in the immediately preceding batch (Medium: any of the previous three; Hard: any of the previous five) '
        'into the submission tray.',
        '目标：观察每一批物品。从第二批起，把出现在上一批（Medium：前三批任一；Hard：前五批任一）中的那一个物品放进提交盘。',
        'There are N = 2 / 4 / 6 answer batches. Each batch has one chance: the first item placed and supported in the tray is the answer and cannot be swapped. The next batch starts after the '
        'answer is locked.',
        '答题批数 N = 2/4/6。每批只有一次机会：第一个放进并被提交盘托住的物品就是答案，不能换。答案锁定后进入下一批。',
        'A batch is correct when its answer is the repeated item. The episode ends when the required sequence is complete (or the budget is used); the recorded events and final state are scored.',
        '答案是重复物品即该批正确。规定的序列完成即结束（或预算用完）；按记录的事件和结束时状态计分。',
        ['100: all N batches correct.', 'Otherwise: 30 / 22 / 15 × (correct batches) / N.'],
        ['100：N 批全部正确。', '否则：30 / 22 / 15 × 正确批数 / N。']),
 'E2': ('Serial Code Entry',
        'Working memory and arithmetic — compute a value and enter it serially.',
        '工作记忆与计算——算出数值并逐位输入。',
        'Goal: Memorise the shown entity–value pairs, compute the physical expression, and enter the exact result on the nine keys.',
        '目标：记住显示的物体–数值对应关系，算出表达式，在九个键上输入准确结果。',
        'Enter one digit at a time. A key counts as pressed at ≥3 mm travel; the next digit is accepted only after the previous key has returned. Repeated digits need separate presses.',
        '逐位输入。按下 ≥3mm 算一次输入；上一个键弹回后才接受下一位。重复数字要分别按。',
        'Correct when the entered digits exactly match the answer and the last key has returned. The episode ends when the required sequence is complete (or the budget is used); the recorded events '
        'and final state are scored.',
        '输入数字与答案完全一致且最后一键已弹回即正确。规定的序列完成即结束（或预算用完）；按记录的事件和结束时状态计分。',
        ['100: exact digits and last key returned.', 'Otherwise: 30 / 22 / 15 × (digits correct in position) / (code length).'],
        ['100：数字完全一致且末键弹回。', '否则：30 / 22 / 15 × 位置正确的位数 / 密码位数。']),
 'S1': ('Carousel Colour Restoration',
        'Spatial tracking — remember physical slots through rotation.',
        '空间追踪——转动后仍记住实体槽位。',
        'Goal: Remember which colour belongs to each physical slot, watch the carousel rotate, and after it stops put each block into its original slot.',
        '目标：记住每个实体槽对应的颜色，看转盘转动，停下后把每个方块放回原来的槽。',
        'The slots show colour cues for one second, then the carousel rotates with direction changes. A block counts when it is supported by its slot with its centre inside. You may correct '
        'placements; holding a block while waiting is allowed.',
        '槽位颜色提示显示 1 秒，然后转盘带换向转动。方块被对应槽托住且中心在槽内就算放对。可以纠正；等待时手里拿着方块也可以。',
        'Success: all 4 blocks are in their original slots. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the '
        'episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
        '成功：4 块都在原来的槽里。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
        ['100: all 4 correct.', '15 / 11 / 7.5: 3 correct.', '7.5 / 5.5 / 3.75: 2 correct.', '0: 0–1 correct.'],
        ['100：4 块都对。', '15 / 11 / 7.5：3 块。', '7.5 / 5.5 / 3.75：2 块。', '0：0–1 块。']),
 'S2': ('Forbidden-Cell Navigation',
        'Spatial memory — navigate around remembered forbidden cells.',
        '空间记忆——绕开记住的禁区导航。',
        'Goal: Remember the briefly lit forbidden cells, then press and release the arrow buttons (one cell per press) to move the slider into the ring without entering a forbidden cell or leaving '
        'the board.',
        '目标：记住短暂亮起的禁区格，然后按下并松开方向按钮（每按一次走一格），把滑块移进目标圈，不进入禁区、不出棋盘。',
        '4 × 4 / 5 × 5 / 6 × 6 board (Easy / Medium / Hard). A press counts at ≥3 mm travel and must return below 1 mm before the next one; pressing two directions at once is invalid. A shortest '
        'route is not required.',
        '棋盘 4×4 / 5×5 / 6×6（Easy / Medium / Hard）。按下 ≥3mm 算一次，回到 <1mm 才能再按；同时按两个方向无效。不要求最短路线。',
        'Success: the slider is in the ring and never entered a forbidden cell or left the board. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the '
        'episode ends with 100. Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
        '成功：滑块进入目标圈，且从未进入禁区格、没出过棋盘。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
        ['100: in the ring with no forbidden cell entered and no boundary crossed.', '0: otherwise.'],
        ['100：到达目标圈且从未进禁区、未出界。', '0：其他。']),
 'P1': ('Order Fulfilment',
        'Incremental memory — accumulate orders and fulfil them exactly.',
        '增量记忆——累计订单并精确完成。',
        'Goal: Remember the initial orders and any additional orders shown later (each adds to earlier demand), and place all requested ingredients into the indicated containers.',
        '目标：记住初始订单和之后追加的订单（追加是累加），把要求的食材全部放进指定的杯子。',
        'There are 4 / 5 / 7 requested items in total. An ingredient counts when it is supported inside the container. Let m = missing + wrong + extra items.',
        '共 4/5/7 个需求。食材被杯子托住且在杯内就算放入。设 m = 漏放 + 放错 + 多放 的个数。',
        'Success: after all orders have been shown, every container matches its total order exactly (m = 0). After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it '
        'holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
        '成功：所有订单展示完后，每个杯子与累计订单完全一致（m=0）。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
        ['100: m = 0.', '15 / 11 / 7.5: m = 1.', '7.5 / 5.5 / 3.75: m = 2.', '0: m ≥ 3.'],
        ['100：m=0。', '15 / 11 / 7.5：m=1。', '7.5 / 5.5 / 3.75：m=2。', '0：m≥3。']),
 'P2': ('Steamer Basket Restacking',
        'Sequence memory — rebuild a stack in its original order.',
        '顺序记忆——按原顺序复原叠放。',
        'Goal: Remove the lid, remember the dim-sum order as you unstack the target baskets, then restack them on the left steamer pot in the same bottom-to-top order and replace the lid.',
        '目标：拿下盖子，拆下目标蒸笼时记住点心顺序，然后在左边蒸锅上按原来从下到上的顺序叠回去，再盖上盖子。',
        'There are 3 / 4 / 4 target baskets (Hard adds distractors; a distractor in the stack counts as wrong). Each layer must be within 10 mm horizontally, 3 mm vertically and 5° tilt, supported '
        'by the layer below.Let p = correct layers counted from the bottom.',
        '目标蒸笼 3/4/4 个（Hard 有干扰蒸笼，叠进去算错）。每层水平误差 ≤10mm、高度 ≤3mm、倾斜 ≤5°，并由下一层托住。设 p = 从锅底起连续摆对的层数。',
        'Success: all target layers correct and the lid is on. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the '
        'episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
        '成功：所有目标层正确且盖子盖好。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
        ['100: all layers and the lid correct.', '30 / 22 / 15: all layers correct, lid not.', '20 / 15 / 10: p ≥ half of the layers.', '10 / 7.5 / 5: 0 < p < half.', '0: p = 0.'],
        ['100：全部层与盖子正确。', '30 / 22 / 15：层全对但盖子没盖好。', '20 / 15 / 10：p ≥ 一半。', '10 / 7.5 / 5：0<p< 一半。', '0：p=0。']),
 'F1': ('Unknown Button Mapping and Slider Navigation',
        'Causal exploration — learn button effects, then plan the shortest route.',
        '因果探索——摸清按钮作用，再规划最短路线。',
        'Goal: Press and release every unmarked button at least once to learn how it moves the slider. After the slider resets and the goal appears, reach the goal with the fewest presses.',
        '目标：把每个无标记按钮至少按一次，弄清它怎么移动滑块。滑块复位、目标出现后，用最少的按键次数到达目标。',
        '2 / 4 / 4 buttons on a line / 3×3 / 4×4 grid. A press counts at ≥2.5 mm travel and returns below 0.8 mm; a press at the boundary that does not move the slider still counts. Exploration '
        'presses do not count toward the route. Any shortest route is accepted. Move the slider only through the buttons.',
        '2/4/4 个按钮，对应直线 / 3×3 / 4×4 网格。按下 ≥2.5mm 算一次，回到 <0.8mm 算弹回；在边界上按了但滑块没动也算一次。任何一条最短路线都接受。只能通过按钮移动滑块。',
        'Success: exploration complete and the slider reaches the goal with the minimum number of route presses. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as '
        'it holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
        '成功：探索完整，并以最少的路线按键次数到达目标。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
        ['100: exploration complete and goal reached with the minimum presses.',
         '15 / 11 / 7.5: goal reached with more presses.',
         '7.5 / 5.5 / 3.75: goal reached but the last button has not returned.',
         '0: otherwise.'],
        ['100：探索完整且最少步到达。', '15 / 11 / 7.5：到达但不是最少步。', '7.5 / 5.5 / 3.75：到达但最后一个键没弹回。', '0：其他。']),
 'F2': ('Feedback Permutation Inference',
        'Deductive reasoning — infer a hidden order from feedback.',
        '演绎推理——根据反馈推出隐藏顺序。',
        'Goal: Place one coloured block in each slot, then press and release the confirmation button; use the brief feedback (number of correct positions) to infer the hidden permutation in as few '
        'submissions as possible.',
        '目标：每个槽放一个色块，然后按下并松开确认按钮；根据短暂显示的反馈（有几个位置对了）推出隐藏的排列，提交次数越少越好。',
        '3 / 4 / 5 blocks; at most 5 / 6 / 7 submissions. An incomplete arrangement is not a submission. A block counts when it is supported in a slot with its centre inside. Movement during the '
        'opening display is allowed and not penalised.',
        '3/4/5 个色块；最多提交 5/6/7 次。没放满不算提交。色块被槽托住且中心在槽内就算放入。开头展示期间动了不罚。',
        'Correct when a submission has every block in the right slot and the arrangement is still correct at the end. The episode ends when the required sequence is complete (or the budget is used); '
        'the recorded events and final state are scored.',
        '某次提交全部正确，且结束时排列仍正确，即为正确。规定的序列完成即结束（或预算用完）；按记录的事件和结束时状态计分。',
        ['100: a fully correct submission, still correct at the end.', '0: otherwise.'],
        ['100：某次提交全对且结束时仍全对。', '0：其他。']),
 'M1': ('Workpiece Tracking and Route Replay',
        'Object tracking and route memory — follow a hidden target and replay its route.',
        '目标追踪与路线记忆——跟踪被遮住的目标并复现路线。',
        "Goal: Remember the target's location and its station route, track it through the cover exchanges, uncover it, and place it on the stations in route order.",
        '目标：记住目标物的位置和站点路线，跟踪它在罩子交换中的去向，打开罩子取出，并按路线顺序放到各站台。',
        'The route has N = 4 / 5 / 6 stops including revisits. Each placement supported on a station pad is one submission and cannot be undone; the first N submissions are your answer. A revisit '
        'needs a new placement after leaving the station.',
        '路线有 N = 4/5/6 站（含重复到访）。每次放稳在站台上算一次提交，不能撤回；前 N 次提交就是答案。重复到访需要离开该站后重新放一次。',
        'Let C = longest part of your submissions that matches the route in order, W = submissions − C, m = N − C + W. Correct when the submissions match the route exactly and the target ends on the '
        'last station. The episode ends when the required sequence is complete (or the budget is used); the recorded events and final state are scored.',
        '设 C = 你的提交与路线按顺序对上的最长部分，W = 提交数 − C，m = N − C + W。提交与路线完全一致且目标最后停在终点站即正确。规定的序列完成即结束（或预算用完）；按记录的事件和结束时状态计分。',
        ['100: exact route and target on the last station.', '15 / 11 / 7.5: m = 1.', '7.5 / 5.5 / 3.75: m = 2.', '0: otherwise.'],
        ['100：路线完全一致且停在终点站。', '15 / 11 / 7.5：m=1。', '7.5 / 5.5 / 3.75：m=2。', '0：其他。']),
 'M2': ('Card Pair Matching',
        'Spatial memory — remember card positions and match pairs.',
        '空间记忆——记住卡片位置并配对。',
        "Goal: Press and release a card's yellow button to turn it face up, reveal at most two unmatched cards at a time, and match every pair.",
        '目标：按下并松开卡片的黄色按钮把它翻开，同时最多翻开两张未配对的牌，把所有对子配完。',
        '2 / 4 / 8 pairs. Matching pictures stay face up; mismatches turn back automatically. Wait for the flip or pair result to finish before selecting another card; a selection counts when the '
        'button is released while the card is ready.',
        '2/4/8 对。图案相同的保持翻开；不同的会自动翻回。等翻牌或配对结果结束后再选下一张；在卡片就绪时松开按钮才算选中。',
        'Success: every pair matched and all cards face up (hinge within 2°). After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends with '
        '100. Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
        '成功：全部配对且所有牌翻正（铰链角误差 <2°）。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
        ['100: all pairs matched and face up.', 'Otherwise: 30 / 22 / 15 × (matched pairs) / N, N = 2 / 4 / 8.', '0: more than two unmatched cards face up at once.'],
        ['100：全部配对且翻正。', '否则：30 / 22 / 15 × 已配对数 / N（N=2/4/8）。', '0：同时翻开超过两张未配对的牌。']),
 'CP01': ('Conveyor Meal Assembly',
          'Order memory, dynamic picking and multi-tray management.',
          '订单记忆、动态抓取与多盘管理。',
          'Goal: Watch the reference meal trays pass on the conveyor and remember the food types on each; then prepare the matching empty trays and fill each with the same foods from the moving '
          'supply.',
          '目标：看参考餐盘从传送带上经过，记住每盘的食物种类；然后摆好对应的空盘，从移动的供给中取同样的食物放进去。',
          'Easy: 1 order (trays pre-placed); Medium: 2; Hard: 3. Each tray holds three food types. In Medium/Hard, separate the empty trays and place them flat without stacking. A food counts when '
          'it is supported in the correct tray. N = 3 / 6 / 9 foods; tray handling is required for 100 but earns no partial credit.',
          'Easy 1 份订单（餐盘已摆好）；Medium 2 份；Hard 3 份。每盘三种食物。Medium/Hard 要把空盘分开平放，不能叠放。食物被正确的盘子托住才算。N = 3/6/9 份食物；分盘、摆盘是拿 100 的前提，不给部分分。',
          'Success: every tray holds exactly its order with no extra food, after all reference orders have been shown. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as '
          'soon as it holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
          '成功：所有参考订单展示完后，每盘恰好是对应订单、没有多余食物。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
          ['100: all trays correct, no extra food.', 'Otherwise: 15 / 10 / 7 × max(0, correct − wrong − extra) / N.'],
          ['100：每盘都对且无多余。', '否则：15 / 10 / 7 × max(0, 正确−错−多) / N。']),
 'CP02': ('Rotating Cake Decoration',
          'Identity–position memory and rotation tracking.',
          '身份–位置记忆与旋转追踪。',
          'Goal: Remember each macaron and its place on the still cake shown for three seconds and recreate the arrangement. Medium/Hard: open the ingredient-box lid, press the green button and '
          'decorate while the cake rotates. Hard: then press the red button, wait for the cake to stop, and put the cover on.',
          '目标：记住静止蛋糕上展示 3 秒的每个马卡龙及位置，并复原摆放。Medium/Hard：打开配料盒盖、按绿色按钮，在蛋糕转动时装饰。Hard：之后按红色按钮，等蛋糕停下，盖上罩子。',
          'A macaron counts when it is supported by the cake with its centre inside its target circle.The lid must be opened past 90° before START; in Hard, STOP comes after all macarons are placed '
          'and the cover must rest on the base over the cake. N = 4 / 6 / 6 macarons; the lid, START and STOP are required for 100 but earn no partial credit.',
          '马卡龙被蛋糕托住且中心在对应目标圈内就算对。按 START 前盖子要打开超过 90°；Hard 放完马卡龙后再按 STOP，罩子要落在底座上罩住蛋糕。N = 4/6/6 个马卡龙；开盖、START、STOP 是拿 100 的前提，不给部分分。',
          'Success: all required steps and macarons correct with no extra macaron. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends '
          'with 100. Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
          '成功：所有步骤和马卡龙都正确，没有多余。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
          ['100: everything correct, no extra.', 'Otherwise: 15 / 10 / 7 × max(0, correct − wrong − extra) / N.'],
          ['100：全部正确且无多余。', '否则：15 / 10 / 7 × max(0, 正确−错−多) / N。']),
 'CP03': ('Dish Rack Loading',
          'Mechanism operation and dynamic insertion.',
          '机构操作与动态插入。',
          'Goal: Set the lever to the required gear and release it, press the green button so the rack moves, then load 3 / 5 / 7 upright plates into the moving empty slots.',
          '目标：把拨杆拨到要求档位并松开，按绿色按钮让架子动起来，再把 3/5/7 个竖直的盘子放进运动中的空槽。',
          'Easy has the gear preset. Gear within ±2°; START counts at ≥1.5 mm travel. Only plates taken from the source rack by the gripper count; pushed or knocked-in plates and pre-loaded plates '
          'do not. A plate counts when it ends supported in a correct empty slot after entering while the rack moves; releasing above the slot and letting it drop in is fine. N = 3 / 5 / 7 plates; '
          'the gear and START are required for 100 but earn no partial credit.',
          'Easy 档位已预设。档位误差 ±2°；START 按下 ≥1.5mm 算一次。只算夹爪从原料架取来的盘子；推进去、碰进去的和预先装好的不算。盘子在架子运动中进入、最终被正确空槽托住就算对；在槽上方松手让它落进去也可以。N = 3/5/7 个盘子；拨档和 START 是拿 100 的前提，不给部分分。',
          'Success: gear then START done, and every plate correctly loaded. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends with 100. '
          'Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
          '成功：先拨档后按 START，且所有盘子都正确装入。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
          ['100: all correct.', 'Otherwise: 15 / 10 / 7 × max(0, correct − wrong − extra) / N.'],
          ['100：全部正确。', '否则：15 / 10 / 7 × max(0, 正确−错−多) / N。']),
 'CP04': ('Cooking',
          'Recipe-order memory and thermal response.',
          '菜谱顺序记忆与温度响应。',
          'Goal: Medium/Hard: open the drawer. Pour each required jar into the pot in the remembered recipe order, returning jars to their slots and caps to the tray (Medium/Hard: then cover the '
          'pot). Turn the black knob to HEAT and press the green button; within 4 / 3 / 2 s after 80 °C, switch to KEEP WARM, then turn off.',
          '目标：Medium/Hard 先拉开抽屉。按记住的菜谱顺序把需要的罐子倒进锅里，空罐放回原位、盖子放回托盘（Medium/Hard 之后盖上锅盖）。把黑色旋钮转到 HEAT 并按绿色按钮；到 80°C 后 4/3/2 秒内转到 KEEP WARM，然后关火。',
          '2 / 2 / 3 ingredients. Each jar must be uncapped before pouring and its whole portion must end in the pot. There is no second attempt: a wrong pour stays wrong. Jars are checked for being '
          'back in their slots, not for being upright. N = 2 / 2 / 3 ingredients, counted as the longest part that matches the recipe order. The drawer, lid, heat-to-keep-warm, turning off and '
          'returning jars and caps are required for 100 but earn no partial credit.',
          '2/2/3 种材料。倒之前要先开盖，整份都要进锅。不能重来，倒错就是错。罐子只查是否放回原位，不查是否竖直。N = 2/2/3 种材料，按“与菜谱按顺序对上了几份”计。抽屉、锅盖、加热转保温、关火、归还罐盖是拿 100 的前提，不给部分分。',
          'Complete when the heat is turned off with jars and caps returned. The episode ends when the required sequence is complete (or the budget is used); the recorded events and final state are '
          'scored.',
          '关火且罐子、盖子都放回即完成。规定的序列完成即结束（或预算用完）；按记录的事件和结束时状态计分。',
          ['100: every step correct.', 'Otherwise: 15 / 10 / 7 × (ingredients in recipe order) / N.'],
          ['100：所有步骤正确。', '否则：15 / 10 / 7 × 按顺序对上的配料数 / N。']),
 'CP05': ('Electronic Piano Replay',
          'Demonstration sequence memory with a tool.',
          '示范序列记忆与工具使用。',
          'Goal: Hard: set the volume to MAX first and keep it at MAX. Press the triangle-marked Play button, watch the demonstration, then replay the 8 / 8 / 12 key presses in order, and return the '
          'mallet(s) to the rack.',
          '目标：Hard 先把音量调到 MAX 并保持。按带三角标记的 Play 按钮，看示范，然后按顺序复现 8/8/12 个按键，最后把棒放回架子。',
          'Play counts at ≥3 mm travel. A note counts when a key goes down ≥2 mm and returns below 0.5 mm before the next press, whatever touches it. N = 8 / 8 / 12 notes, counted as the longest '
          "part matching the demonstration in order; an extra note prevents 100. Play, mallet return and Hard's MAX (checked before Play and at the end) are required for 100 but earn no partial "
          'credit.',
          'Play 按下 ≥3mm 算一次。琴键压下 ≥2mm、下次按之前回到 <0.5mm 就算一个音，不管用什么碰的。N = 8/8/12 个音，按“与示范按顺序对上了几个”计；多敲一个音就不能得 100。Play、放回棒、Hard 的 MAX（Play 前和结束时都检查）是拿 100 的前提，不给部分分。',
          'Complete when the notes are played and the mallet(s) are back on the rack. The episode ends when the required sequence is complete (or the budget is used); the recorded events and final '
          'state are scored.',
          '音敲完且棒放回架子即完成。规定的序列完成即结束（或预算用完）；按记录的事件和结束时状态计分。',
          ['100: every step correct and no extra note.', 'Otherwise: 15 / 10 / 7 × (notes in demonstrated order) / N.'],
          ['100：全部正确且无多敲。', '否则：15 / 10 / 7 × 按顺序对上的音数 / N。']),
 'CP06': ('Balance-Scale Calibration',
          'Calibration, physical loading and closed-loop balancing.',
          '校准、物理装载与闭环配平。',
          'Goal: Medium/Hard: with both pans empty, press ZERO. Move all fruit from the tray onto the left pan, balance the scale with the weights on the right (Hard: also push the sliding weight '
          'into place), and leave the pointer in the green zone.',
          '目标：Medium/Hard 先在两盘都空时按 ZERO。把托盘上的水果全部放到左盘，用右边的砝码配平（Hard 还要把游码推到位），最后让指针停在绿区。',
          "1 / 2 / 3 fruits; use at least two weights. ZERO counts at ≥4 mm travel; Hard's sliding weight must end at 90 ± 3 mm. Nothing may fall off a pan. N = 3 / 4 / 5 items (each fruit plus the "
          "two required weights), scored independently. ZERO, the green zone and Hard's sliding weight are required for 100 but earn no partial credit.",
          '1/2/3 个水果；至少用两个砝码。ZERO 按下 ≥4mm 算一次；Hard 游码最终在 90±3mm。东西不能从盘上掉下。N = 3/4/5 项（每个水果加两个所需砝码），各项独立计分。ZERO、绿区、Hard 游码是拿 100 的前提，不给部分分。',
          'Success: all items correct and the pointer in the green zone. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends with 100. '
          'Otherwise the episode runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
          '成功：各项都正确且指针在绿区。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
          ['100: everything correct.', 'Otherwise: 15 / 10 / 7 × (correct items) / N.'],
          ['100：全部正确。', '否则：15 / 10 / 7 × 做对项数 / N。']),
 'CP07': ('Bridge Construction and Car Crossing',
          'Select and assemble a functional structure, then verify it works.',
          '选择并搭建可用结构，再验证它能用。',
          'Goal: Build a bridge across the gap with continuous wheel paths on both sides (Medium/Hard: choose suitable pieces from a stock that includes extras), then press and release the button '
          'and let the car drive to the opposite bank.',
          '目标：搭一座两侧车轮路面连续、跨过缺口的桥（Medium/Hard 要从含多余积木的库存中挑选合适的），然后按下并松开按钮，让车开到对岸。',
          'Easy uses all 8 pieces; Medium/Hard use 13 of the stock pieces, and any working choice counts. The car starts after the button is pressed and must reach the opposite bank; only arrival is '
          'scored.',
          'Easy 用全部 8 块；Medium/Hard 从库存中用 13 块，任何能用的组合都可以。按下按钮后车出发，到达对岸即算成功，只看是否到岸。',
          'Success: the car reaches the opposite bank. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the episode '
          'runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
          '成功：车到达对岸。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
          ['100: the car reaches the opposite bank.', '0: otherwise.'],
          ['100：车到达对岸。', '0：其他。']),
 'CP08': ('Structure Reconstruction and Rework',
          'Retain a visual structure and perform hierarchical assembly and rework.',
          '记住视觉结构并完成分层搭建与返工。',
          'Goal: Remember the briefly shown front view, then build the structure from memory in the marked area. Fix any misplaced lower blocks (Hard: lift the beam off, correct the base, then '
          'rebuild). Use only reference-colour blocks.',
          '目标：记住短暂展示的正视图，凭记忆在标记区域搭出结构。修正放错的下层积木（Hard：先把横梁抬下来、修好底座，再重新搭好）。只用参考颜色的积木。',
          'Each block must be in place (horizontal <6 / 4 / 4 mm, vertical <3 mm) and supported by the blocks below. Extra blocks stay outside the build area. N = 3 / 4 / 5 blocks, scored '
          "independently (Hard's pre-installed block A does not count). Hard's lift-off and base fix are required for 100 but earn no partial credit.",
          '每块位置正确（水平 <6/4/4mm、高度 <3mm）并被下面的积木托住。多余积木留在搭建区外。N = 3/4/5 块积木，各自独立计分（Hard 预装的 A 块不算）。Hard 的抬梁、修底座是拿 100 的前提，不给部分分。',
          'Success: the whole structure is correct. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the episode '
          'runs until the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
          '成功：整体结构正确。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
          ['100: whole structure correct.', 'Otherwise: 15 / 10 / 7 × (correct blocks) / N.'],
          ['100：结构全部正确。', '否则：15 / 10 / 7 × 放对积木数 / N。']),
 'CP09': ('Whiteboard Restoration',
          'Retain visual content and restore it with tools.',
          '记住画面内容并用工具复原。',
          'Goal: Remember the briefly shown original drawing on the whiteboard, erase the added strokes and redraw any original strokes you erased (Medium/Hard: uncap the pens of the colours '
          'needed), so the board matches the original.',
          '目标：记住白板上短暂展示的原图，擦掉多出来的笔画，补画被擦掉的原笔画（Medium/Hard 要拔开所需颜色的笔帽），让白板恢复原样。',
          '1 / 2 / 3 colours. A colour is repaired when its ink matches the original with precision and recall ≥95% (within 1.5 mm) and extra ink ≤3%; an intact colour counts automatically. How much '
          'you erase is not limited. Ink must come from real tool contact.',
          '1/2/3 种颜色。某颜色墨迹与原图相比，精确率和召回率都 ≥95%（容差 1.5mm）且多余墨迹 ≤3%，就算修好；原本完好的颜色自动算对。擦多少不限。墨迹必须来自工具真实接触。',
          'Success: every colour repaired. After each of your actions the environment checks the 100-point condition; as soon as it holds the episode ends with 100. Otherwise the episode runs until '
          'the budget is used and the final state is scored.',
          '成功：所有颜色都修好。你每做完一个动作，环境检查一次 100 分条件；一满足就以 100 分结束。否则跑到预算用完，按结束时的状态计分。',
          ['100: all colours repaired.', 'Otherwise: 15 / 10 / 7 × (repaired colours) / (colours).'],
          ['100：所有颜色修好。', '否则：15 / 10 / 7 × 修好颜色数 / 颜色数。']),
 'CP10': ('Ball Prediction and Blocker Return',
          'Predict trajectories and act on delayed colour information.',
          '预测轨迹并根据延迟出现的颜色行动。',
          "Goal: Predict each ball from the launcher's settled aim. After two practice balls, use the sliding blocker to return every white ball to the far net and let every red ball pass untouched "
          'into the near net.',
          '目标：根据发射器稳定后的瞄准方向预判来球。两个练习球之后，用滑动挡板把每个白球挡回远网，让每个红球不碰挡板进入近网。',
          'Colour shows only after launch. 5 / 8 / 12 scored balls; practice balls never count and practice problems do not stop the session. Do not touch a ball with the robot. A ball counts when '
          'it ends in the correct net. N = scored white balls = 3 / 4 / 6.',
          '颜色在发射后才显示。机器人不要直接碰球。球最终进入正确的网就算对。N = 正式白球数 = 3/4/6。',
          'Complete when all scored balls have been launched and settled. The episode ends when the required sequence is complete (or the budget is used); the recorded events and final state are '
          'scored.',
          '正式球全部发完并落定即完成。规定的序列完成即结束（或预算用完）；按记录的事件和结束时状态计分。',
          ['100: every scored ball correct.', 'Otherwise: 15 / 10 / 7 × k / N, where k = correct white balls before the first wrong scored ball.', '0: the robot touched a ball.'],
          ['100：所有正式球都对。', '否则：15 / 10 / 7 × k / N，k = 第一个错误正式球之前打对的白球数。', '0：机器人直接碰球。'])}
